#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &kmplot;"
msgstr "Konfiguracija &kmplot;"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:3
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access the &kmplot; configuration dialog, select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kmplot;...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> The settings for <guimenuitem>Constants...</"
"guimenuitem> can only be changed from the <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> menu and "
"the <guimenuitem>Coordinate System...</guimenuitem> only from the "
"<guimenu>View</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Da pristupite &kmplot; dijalogu konfiguracije, odaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kmplot;...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> Opcije za <guimenuitem>Konstante...</guimenuitem> "
"mogu biti promjenjene iz  <guimenu>Izmijeni</guimenu> menija i "
"<guimenuitem>Koordinatni Sistem...</guimenuitem> samo iz <guimenu>Pogled</"
"guimenu> menija."

#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Configuration"
msgstr "Opšta podešavanja"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: configuration.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the General Settings dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo> Slika dijaloga za glavne postavke </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: configuration.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the General Settings dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Screenshot dijaloga za glavne postavke </phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can set global settings which automatic will be saved when you exit "
"&kmplot;. you can set angle-mode (radians and degrees), zoom in and zoom out "
"factors, and whether to show advanced plot tracing."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete postaviti globalne postavke koje automatski će biti sačuvane "
"kada izađete &kmplot;. Možete podesiti orijenatciju pogleda (radijana i "
"stupnjeva), uvećanje i umanjenje faktora i da li će pokazati napredne opcije "
"traženja."

#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Diagram Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracije dijagrama"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: configuration.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the Diagram Appearance dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Screenshot dijaloga izgleda dijagrama </screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: configuration.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the Diagram Appearance dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Screenshot dijaloga izgleda dijagrama</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can set the <guilabel>Grid Style</guilabel> to one of four options:"
msgstr ""
"Možete postaviti  <guilabel>Grid Style</guilabel> na jednu od četiri opcije:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "None"
msgstr "Ništa"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "No gridlines are drawn on the plot area"
msgstr "Linije mreže nisu nacrtane u području crtanja"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lines"
msgstr "Linije"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Straight lines form a grid of squares on the plot area."
msgstr "Prave mrežne linije od kvadrata na grafičkom prostoru."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Crosses"
msgstr "Presjeci"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Crosses are drawn to indicate points where x and y have integer values "
"(&eg;, (1,1), (4,2) &etc;)."
msgstr ""
"Presjeci su nacrtani da pokažu gdje x i y imaju cjelobrojne crijednosti "
"(&eg;, (1,1), (4,2) &etc;)."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Polar"
msgstr "Polarna"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lines of constant radius and of constant angle are drawn on the plot area."
msgstr ""
"Linije konstantnog radijusa i konstantnog ugla su nacrtane na grafičkom "
"prostoru."

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Other options for the diagram appearance can also be configured:"
msgstr "Ostale opcije za drijagram takođe mogu biti konfigurisane:"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Axis Labels"
msgstr "Oznake osa."

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets labels for the horizontal and vertical axes."
msgstr "Postavite labela za horizontalne i vertikalne ose."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "Axis width:"
msgstr "Širina ose:"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the width of the lines representing the axes."
msgstr "Postavlja širinu linije koja predstavlja osu."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "Line width:"
msgstr "Širina linije:"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the width of the lines used for drawing the grid."
msgstr "Postavlja širinu linije korištene za crtanje koordinatne mreže."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tic width:"
msgstr "Širina podioka:"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the width of the lines representing tics on the axes."
msgstr "Postavlja širinu linije koja predstavlja širinu podioka na osi."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tic length:"
msgstr "Dužina podioka."

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sets the length of the lines representing tics on the axes."
msgstr "Postavlja dužinu linije koja predstavlja širinu podioka na osi."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show labels"
msgstr "Prikaži labele"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If checked, the names of the axes are shown on the plot and the axes' tics "
"are labeled."
msgstr ""
"Ako je označeno, imena osa će biti prekazana na grafu i podiok će biti "
"označen."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show axes"
msgstr "Pokaži ose"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "If checked, the axes are visible."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, ose su vidljive."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show arrows"
msgstr "Pokaži strelice"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid "If checked, the axes are displayed with arrows at their ends."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, ose će biti prikazane sa strelicama na kraju."

#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colors Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija boja."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: configuration.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the Colors dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Slika dijaloga boja</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: configuration.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the Colors dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Slika dijaloga boja</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Coords</guilabel> section of the <guilabel>Colors</"
"guilabel> configuration dialog, you can change the colors of the axes, the "
"grid and the background of the main &kmplot; area."
msgstr ""
"U <guilabel>>Koordinatnom</guilabel> odjeljku <guilabel>Boje</guilabel> "
"podešavajučeg dijaloga, možete mjenjati boje osa, koordinatne mreže i "
"pozadinu glavnog &kmplot; područja."

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Default Function Colors</guilabel> control which colors are "
"cycled through when creating new functions."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Podrazumijevane boje funkcija</guilabel> kontrole koje ciklično "
"boje kada se kreira nova funckija."

#. Tag: title
#: configuration.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fonts Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija fonta"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: configuration.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Screenshot of the Fonts dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Screenshot dijaloga fonta</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: configuration.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Screenshot of the Fonts dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Screenshot dijaloga fonta</phrase>"

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid "Axis labels"
msgstr "Oznake osa"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "The font used for drawing the axis numbers and x/y labels."
msgstr "Font korišten za pisanje osnih brojeva i x/y labela."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "Diagram label"
msgstr "Dijagram labela"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The font used for drawing diagram labels (&eg;, those showing the plot name "
"or extreme points)."
msgstr ""
"Font korišten za crtanje dijagrama labela  (&eg;, oni koji pokazuju ime "
"grafa ili ekstremne tačke)."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: configuration.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "Header table"
msgstr "Zaglavlje tabele"

#. Tag: para
#: configuration.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid "The font used for drawing the header when printing a plot."
msgstr "Font korišten za crtanje zaglavlja kada je graf na pritanju."
